---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import IncentivizedTestnetNotice from '../../../components/IncentivizedTestnetNotice.astro';
import HubNav from '../../../components/HubNav.astro';
import '../../../styles/hub-common.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Developers — Testnet Portal"
  description="Boing Network testnet: developer community and dApp registration."
>
  <article class="portal-page role-hub developers-hub hub-page hub-developer" data-hub="developer">
    <script is:inline src="/portal-session.js"></script>
    <div class="hub-page-main">
    <HubNav hub="developer" current="index" />
    <IncentivizedTestnetNotice />
    <div class="hub-hero fade-in-up">
      <h1>Developer Hub</h1>
      <p class="lead">
        Build dApps on public testnet <strong>6913</strong> and register contracts for tracking. This hub is for <strong>developers</strong> only.
        Incentivized rewards and the mainnet dApp incentive pool are <strong>not</strong> active — registration is for soak and future eligibility design, not a claim.
        Framing: <a href="/pdfs/BOING-TOKENOMICS-AND-INCENTIVIZED-TESTNET.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Tokenomics &amp; testnet (PDF)</a>.
      </p>
      <div class="hub-ctas" id="hub-ctas">
        <a href="/developers/quickstart" class="btn btn-primary">Quickstart</a>
        <a href="/faucet" class="btn btn-secondary">Get faucet BOING</a>
        <a href="/testnet/join" class="btn btn-secondary">RPC &amp; endpoints</a>
        <a href="/testnet/developers/resources" class="btn btn-secondary">Resources</a>
        <a href="/testnet/register/developer" class="btn btn-secondary">Register (optional)</a>
        <a href="/testnet/sign-in" class="btn btn-secondary">Sign in</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="section hub-glance-section fade-in-up delay-1" aria-label="Hub at a glance">
      <h2>Hub at a glance</h2>
      <div class="testnet-glance" id="developer-hub-glance">
        <div class="testnet-glance__card">
          <span class="testnet-glance__value" id="dev-glance-dapps">—</span>
          <span class="testnet-glance__label">dApps registered</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hub-dapp-strip hub-dapp-strip--deco" id="developer-hub-strip" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section steps-section fade-in-up delay-1">
      <h2>Your journey</h2>
      <ol class="steps-list steps-list--numbered">
        <li><strong>Get testnet BOING</strong> — Use the <a href="/faucet">faucet</a> for gas and deployment. Public RPC: <code>https://testnet-rpc.boing.network/</code>.</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Build &amp; deploy</strong> — Follow the <a href="/developers/quickstart">quickstart</a> (CLI, SDK <code>@boing-network/boing-sdk@^0.5.38</code>). Deploy a contract. Endpoints and pool ids: <a href="/testnet/join">Join Testnet</a>. Native DEX routing and wallet handoff for sibling repos (Express, Observer) are documented in the open-source repo:
          <a href="https://github.com/Boing-Network/boing.network/blob/main/docs/HANDOFF-DEPENDENT-PROJECTS.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HANDOFF-DEPENDENT-PROJECTS.md</a>
          and
          <a href="https://github.com/Boing-Network/boing.network/blob/main/docs/THREE-CODEBASE-ALIGNMENT.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">THREE-CODEBASE-ALIGNMENT.md</a>.
          Pinned **token** bytecode (minimal and secured), SDK helpers, and env overrides:
          <a href="https://github.com/Boing-Network/boing.network/blob/main/docs/BOING-CANONICAL-DEPLOY-ARTIFACTS.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BOING-CANONICAL-DEPLOY-ARTIFACTS.md</a>.
        </li>
        <li><strong>Track your dApp on testnet</strong> — Add your contract on the <a href="/testnet/developers/dashboard">Dashboard</a>. When mainnet and metrics RPC exist, the planned method is <code>boing_registerDappMetrics</code> (not live today).</li>
        <li><strong>Optional: register in the portal</strong> — Add your account and optional GitHub/Discord on the <a href="/testnet/register/developer">developer registration</a> page. Does not unlock incentive rewards today.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="section fade-in-up delay-2">
      <h2>dApp incentive pool</h2>
      <p>
        A portion of the <strong>Community & Grants</strong> allocation is reserved for <strong>successful dApps</strong>: rewards are based on usage (e.g. fees generated), with a <strong>per-dApp value cap</strong> per epoch. This describes the protocol design; no dApp incentive pool is currently active. See
        <a href="/pdfs/BOING-BLOCKCHAIN-DESIGN-PLAN.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BOING-BLOCKCHAIN-DESIGN-PLAN (PDF)</a>
        and
        <a href="/pdfs/DEVELOPMENT-AND-ENHANCEMENTS.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DEVELOPMENT-AND-ENHANCEMENTS (PDF)</a>.
      </p>
      <p><a href="/testnet/developers/dashboard" class="btn btn-secondary">My Dashboard</a> · <a href="/testnet/developers/community" class="btn btn-secondary">Community</a> · <a href="/testnet/developers/resources" class="btn btn-secondary">Resources</a></p>
    </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<script is:inline src="/portal-session.js"></script>
<script>
  (function () {
    var session = window.BoingPortalSession && window.BoingPortalSession.getSession();
    var authEl = document.getElementById('portal-auth');
    var hubCtas = document.getElementById('hub-ctas');
    if (session && session.role !== 'developer') {
      var path = window.BoingPortalSession ? window.BoingPortalSession.roleAppPath(session.role) : '/testnet';
      window.location.href = path;
      return;
    }
    function renderAuth() {
      if (!authEl) return;
      if (!session) {
        authEl.innerHTML = '<a href="/testnet/sign-in" class="auth-link">Sign in</a>';
        return;
      }
      var short = window.BoingPortalSession ? window.BoingPortalSession.shortAccount(session.account_id_hex) : session.account_id_hex;
      authEl.innerHTML = 'Signed in as <span class="account-short">' + short + '</span> · <button type="button" id="portal-signout" class="auth-signout">Logout</button>';
      if (hubCtas) hubCtas.style.display = 'none';
      var so = document.getElementById('portal-signout');
      if (so) so.addEventListener('click', function () {
        if (window.BoingPortalSession && window.BoingPortalSession.logout) window.BoingPortalSession.logout();
        else { try { localStorage.removeItem('boing_portal_session'); } catch(_){} window.location.href = '/'; }
      });
    }
    renderAuth();

    var glanceEl = document.getElementById('dev-glance-dapps');
    var stripEl = document.getElementById('developer-hub-strip');
    fetch('/api/portal/dapps').then(function (r) { return r.json().catch(function () { return {}; }); }).then(function (data) {
      var n = (data.ok && data.dapps) ? data.dapps.length : 0;
      if (glanceEl) glanceEl.textContent = typeof n === 'number' ? n : '—';
      if (stripEl && n > 0) {
        for (var i = 0; i < Math.min(n, 10); i++) {
          var pill = document.createElement('span');
          pill.className = 'hub-dapp-strip__pill';
          stripEl.appendChild(pill);
        }
      }
    }).catch(function () {});
  })();
</script>
